+// tables - scripts/minigames/game_trail/scripts/*/trail_clue_*_reward.rs2 - and every one of them
+// is a clue VARIANT rather than something a shop sells: the god, gold-trimmed, trimmed and
+// heraldic armour by name, plus the costume pieces clues are the only source of. Battery group 55
